  "limitations": "Observed expert routes; no history prediction error included. Odd widths train; even widths are held out. Workload selection is explicit. Elapsed timing includes instrumentation and concurrent scheduling. Short-context corpus only; not a serving-default qualification.",
  "excluded_non_verification_batches": {},
  "archive_note": "All original cost observations and acceptance records are reproduced exactly in release-v5-full-single-calibration.tar.gz; the fitter and source hashes are included. This fit report retains original full-trace identities.",
  "decision": "Experimental only. Compared with the legacy formula, mixed timing fit improves while several other held-out cohorts worsen. The legacy formula is not the existing single-RTX embedded placement profile; a serving default change requires separate evidence."
